  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "outback-meet",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Myrie sent you? Of course she did. She worries.",
      "next": "om-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "om-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "I'd come home, but I can't. Farmers have been vanishing from the forest edge, and I'm the only one looking.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-forest-witch-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The tracks lead deeper into the woods. They're not quite human.",
      "next": "the-forest-witch-o1",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-forest-witch-o1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "I could use another pair of eyes. And hands.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Let's find them.",
          "next": "the-forest-witch-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "the-forest-witch"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-forest-witch-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Stay close.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "witch-done",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "A map of tunnels... and a stairway under the town. Under MY town. How long has that been there?",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-dungeon-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "I'm going down those stairs. Coming?",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Right behind you.",
          "next": "the-first-dungeon-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "the-first-dungeon"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-dungeon-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Meet me there.",
      "next": "stairs",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stairs",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Here. Behind the old well. You'd never find it without the scroll.",
      "next": "st-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "st-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Weapons ready.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dungeon-done",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "These halls are old. Older than the town. Older than the Cathedral.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1400,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-catacombs-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "There are entrances like this all over the Layland. Eight that I know of. I want to know how they connect.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Let's explore.",
          "next": "the-catacombs-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "the-catacombs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1680,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-catacombs-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Keep the torch high.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1680,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "maps",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Let me see... they fit. They all fit together.",
      "next": "maps-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "takeItem",
          "item": "catacomb-map",
          "qty": 1
        }
      ],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1960,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "maps-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "There aren't eight dungeons. There's one: one great catacomb under the whole Layland, with eight doors.",
      "next": "maps-3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1960,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "maps-3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "And there's someone guarding the way out. I can hear the armour from here.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1960,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "raid-start",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Whoever's down there, we go through them.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "startQuest",
          "quest": "the-raid-boss"
        }
      ],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2240,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trajan",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "\"The Emperor will be pleased.\" With what? With us? With him dying?",
      "next": "tr-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2520,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tr-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Go back to town. Tell Myrie... no. Let her find out from me.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2520,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
